  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5604.03 Authorizing Employees or Agents to Use Account",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5604.03 Authorizing Employees or Agents to Use Account.\n\n(a) An account holder may authorize an employee or agent to use a prepaid account by submitting a certificate of authority as specified in Saf-C 5603.\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02",
